        "answer": {
          "short": "What is the cost of flour per cake in dollars?",
          "worked": "The related rates are cost per gram and grams per cake:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\text{cost}}{\\text{cake}}&=\\frac{\\text{cost}}{\\text{mass}}\\times\\frac{\\text{mass}}{\\text{cake}}\\end{align*}$$\nThe units are $\\dfrac{\\$}{\\text{g}}\\times\\dfrac{\\text{g}}{\\text{cake}}=\\dfrac{\\$}{\\text{cake}}$, so the calculation answers: What is the cost of flour per cake in dollars?",
